                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "VRIQ is an IQ experiment in VR.  It worked on my system, looked ok, played ok, sounded ok.  The tests has a timer of 5 minutes and you can take it over and over i guess.  I guess the point of this program is to play it the best you can and the dev gets the score.  The dev takes all the scores and figures out something with the data.  There is no instructions.  The perfect score is 24 / 24.  Some of the things i can do is pick up keys to unlock chests, press buttons on posts, stack colored shapes on correct spots on table.  Not sure if you can move around the room.  You can extend your arms out to reach anywhere.  \n\nTry it and delete it. \n\nFor more info:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ftCKuRFshrk\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OejVgKO9blg\n\nhttps://www.reddit.com/r/oculus/comments/6923hk/vriq_making_people_smarter_through_vr/\n\nhttps://3diq.io/site/index.html",
